<% content_for :title, "Privacy Policy - Mezzanine" %>

<main class="legal">
  <article class="legal-content">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: August 23, 2026</p>

    <p>
      Mezzanine Cowork ("we", "us", or "our") operates the website at mezzaninecowork.com and
      provides coworking services at R. Brito e Cunha 27, 4450-081 Matosinhos, Portugal.
      This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal data in
      accordance with the General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR) and applicable Portuguese law.
    </p>

    <h2>Data we collect</h2>
    <p>We may collect the following personal data:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Contact information</strong> — name, email address, and any message you send through our contact form.</li>
      <li><strong>Usage data</strong> — pages visited, browser type, and device information collected through cookies and similar technologies.</li>
      <li><strong>Communication data</strong> — records of correspondence if you contact us by email or other channels.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>How we use your data</h2>
    <p>We use your personal data to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to enquiries and provide information about our coworking services.</li>
      <li>Operate and improve our website.</li>
      <li>Comply with legal obligations.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Our legal bases for processing are your consent (for contact form submissions and non-essential cookies),
      our legitimate interest in operating our business, and compliance with legal requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>Cookies</h2>
    <p>
      We use essential cookies required for the website to function. With your consent, we may also use
      third-party services such as embedded Google Maps, which may set their own cookies.
      You can accept or reject non-essential cookies using the banner shown on your first visit.
    </p>

    <h2>Data sharing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your personal data. We may share data with service providers who assist us in
      operating our website (such as hosting providers), always under appropriate data processing agreements.
      Third-party embeds (e.g. Google Maps) are subject to their own privacy policies.
    </p>

    <h2>Data retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain contact form submissions for as long as needed to respond to your enquiry and for a
      reasonable period thereafter. Cookie preferences are stored locally in your browser until you clear them.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>Under the GDPR, you have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access, rectify, or erase your personal data.</li>
      <li>Restrict or object to processing.</li>
      <li>Data portability, where applicable.</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent at any time, without affecting prior processing.</li>
      <li>Lodge a complaint with the Portuguese Data Protection Authority (CNPD).</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For any privacy-related questions or to exercise your rights, contact us at
      <%= link_to "hello@mezzaninecowork.com", "mailto:hello@mezzaninecowork.com" %>.
    </p>
  </article>
</main>
